                      (    forth6809.asm):03897         ; TSTLOGIC - logic, shift, and address-arithmetic tests (glossary
                      (    forth6809.asm):03898         ; section 3.6). Covers every word in that section. Several of
                      (    forth6809.asm):03899         ; these (INVERT, CELLS, CELL+, CHARS, CHAR+, ALIGNED) modify the
                      (    forth6809.asm):03900         ; top of stack in place (LDD/op/STD) rather than PULU/PSHU - the
                      (    forth6809.asm):03901         ; tests verify what's observable via the stack either way, not
                      (    forth6809.asm):03902         ; how each implementation gets there. Three words (CHARS, ALIGN,
                      (    forth6809.asm):03903         ; ALIGNED) are documented no-ops on this system; CHARS/ALIGNED
                      (    forth6809.asm):03904         ; still get a normal single-value test (verifying identity),
                      (    forth6809.asm):03905         ; while ALIGN - which takes no stack arguments at all - gets a
                      (    forth6809.asm):03906         ; dedicated test pushing decoy values to confirm the whole stack,
                      (    forth6809.asm):03907         ; not just one value, is genuinely undisturbed. RSHIFT tested
                      (    forth6809.asm):03908         ; against a negative input specifically, since it's documented
                      (    forth6809.asm):03909         ; logical (zero-fill), not arithmetic (sign-preserving) - the
                      (    forth6809.asm):03910         ; case that actually distinguishes the two conventions, same
                      (    forth6809.asm):03911         ; reasoning already applied to 2/ and FM/MOD vs SM/REM earlier.
                      (    forth6809.asm):03912         ; ------------------------------------------------------------
C19C BDFC2B           (    forth6809.asm):03913         TSTLOGIC:  JSR   CRW
C19F 8EC1B0           (    forth6809.asm):03914                    LDX   #TSTLOGICMSG
C1A2 3610             (    forth6809.asm):03915                    PSHU  X
C1A4 CC0005           (    forth6809.asm):03916                    LDD   #5
C1A7 3606             (    forth6809.asm):03917                    PSHU  D
