                      (    forth6809.asm):09530                                  ; unrelated, earlier instruction happened to
                      (    forth6809.asm):09531                                  ; leave set, not the sign of the value just
                      (    forth6809.asm):09532                                  ; popped. TSTA explicitly tests D's high byte
