F559 DD08             (    forth6809.asm):10026                  STD   CODEHERE   ; where WORD is about to write its parsed
                      (    forth6809.asm):10027                                   ; text. Without this, the compiled path
                      (    forth6809.asm):10028                                   ; below would compile "JSR DOSTR" (3 bytes)
                      (    forth6809.asm):10029                                   ; directly at CODEHERE - the same address
                      (    forth6809.asm):10030                                   ; WORD just used - overwriting the first 2
                      (    forth6809.asm):10031                                   ; characters of the very text being staged,
