                      (    forth6809.asm):10810                                  ; DDOT/DDOTR, i.e. . / .R / D. / D.R) were
                      (    forth6809.asm):10811                                  ; accidentally unaffected - each happens to
                      (    forth6809.asm):10812                                  ; run "LDD SAVEN" (a flag-setting load of the
                      (    forth6809.asm):10813                                  ; true signed value) immediately before PSHU
                      (    forth6809.asm):10814                                  ; D/JSR SIGN, and PSHU doesn't disturb flags -
